      Dr. Vo is an Associate Professor and Head of the Information Technology
      Department at the School of Computer Science and Engineering, International
      University, Vietnam National University Ho Chi Minh City, where she has worked
      since 2007. She received the B.Eng. degree in Electronics and
      Telecommunications in 1999 and the M.Sc. degree in Telecommunications (Radio
      Electronics) in 2003, both from HCMC University of Technology, Vietnam, and the
      Ph.D. degree in Computer Engineering from Kyung Hee University, Korea, in 2014.
