= Recognition

- *2018* \M Outstanding Scientific Publication Award (individual), academic year
  2017--2018, VNU-HCM.
- *2014* \M Patent 10-1425300, "Method for controlling the window size in multipath
  TCP," Korean Intellectual Property Office.
- *1996* \M Third prize, National Mechanical Olympiad, Vietnam (hydraulics).

